OL,3,GNEWSAPC banned for 'derogatory'
OL,4,AWhatsApp comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student police officer has been
OL,7,Fbanned from policing after she was
OL,8,Ffound to have taken part in
OL,9,Finappropriate conversations in a large
OL,10,FWhatsApp group.
OL,12,FPC Charlotte Harper, who was based in
OL,13,FSouth Gloucestershire, was dismissed
OL,14,Ffor gross misconduct after a hearing at
OL,15,FAvon and Somerset Police's headquarters
OL,16,Fin Portishead on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
