OL,3,GNEWSAPC banned for 'derogatory'
OL,4,AWhatsApp comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing was told that Harper had
OL,7,Fidentified herself as a police officer
OL,8,Fon the chat and shown a "derogatory
OL,9,Fattitude" towards the profession. She
OL,10,Falso joined in with "disrespectful
OL,11,Fconversations" about colleagues and a
OL,12,Fpossible domestic abuse survivor.
OL,14,FHarper also ignored a conversation
OL,15,Fabout a drug deal in the group chat
OL,16,Fwhich had almost 100 members.
